    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH7x2041-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Duó Zuòxiāng (鐸作相)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Féng Yòu (逢又) also had poems.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Because he relied on his talent and was narrow-minded and resentful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">scholars despised him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">From the *Jiù Shǐ* (舊史) [Old History].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Angrily scolding</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Zhāng Jiǔlíng (張九齡) for being chancellor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">His nature was quite impetuous and hasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and he would angrily scold at every turn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Kǒng Píngzhòng's (孔平仲) *Xù Shìshuō* (續世說) [Continuation of A New Account of the World].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">He was executed due to his impetuousness and impatience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">In the "Zàn" (贊) [Eulogy] of *Liú Wénjìng* (劉文靜) it says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Wénjìng (文靜) was first executed due to his impetuousness and impatience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">His wording was careless and hasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Xiāo Yǔ's (蕭瑀) nature was straightforward and impetuous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">In the early years of the Zhēnguān (貞觀) era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yuánlíng (元齡) and Rúhuì (如晦) had newly gained the emperor's favor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and affairs were somewhat divided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) could not help but feel some disappointment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and taking advantage of an opportunity, he sharply criticized them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">his wording being careless and hasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">The Tàizōng (太宗) Emperor was angered</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and dismissed him to his home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Unable to tolerate others' shortcomings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) was clear and discerning in his discussions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">but he was unable to tolerate others' shortcomings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Narrow-minded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) was always noble,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">but narrow-minded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Of narrow-minded and impetuous disposition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Chén Zǐ'áng (陳子昂).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">*Táng Shǐ* (唐史) [History of the Tang Dynasty].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Frivolous and showy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Péi Xíngjiǎn (裴行儉) said:</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
